<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Evergreen Media raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Evergreen Media raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Tuesday it had raised its rating for Evergreen Media Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened up 1-7/8 to 27-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
